@startuml
' Diagrama de comunicação — cadastro de encomenda (POST /encomendas)

skinparam backgroundColor #1E1E1E
skinparam defaultFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #AAAAAA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam object {
    BackgroundColor #2D2D2D
    BorderColor #555555
    FontColor #FFFFFF
}
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #2D2D2D
    BorderColor #555555
    FontColor #FFFFFF
}

object ":Solicitante" as Solicitante
object ":PackageController" as Ctrl
object ":SolicitarEntregaService" as Service
object ":ILocalRepository\n(TypeOrmLocalRepository)" as LocalRepo
object ":ICodigoGerador\n(UuidCodigoGerador)" as Cod
object ":IRelogio\n(RelogioSistema)" as Rel
object ":Package" as Pkg
object ":Volume" as Vol
object ":IPackageRepository\n(TypeOrmPackageRepository)" as Repo
object ":INotificador\n(ConsoleNotificador)" as Notif
object ":ILogger\n(ConsoleLogger)" as Log

Solicitante -right-> Ctrl : 1: POST /encomendas
Ctrl -right-> Service : 2: execute(comando)
Service -down-> LocalRepo : 3: findById(localRemetenteId)\n4: findById(localDestinatarioId)
Service -down-> Cod : 5: gerar()
Service -down-> Rel : 6: agora()
Service -down-> Pkg : 7: cadastrar(dados, codigo, instante)
Pkg -right-> Vol : 7.1: criar(descricao, tipo, pesoKg)
Service -down-> Repo : 8: save(encomenda)
Service -down-> Notif : 9: notificar(...) [assíncrono, sem await]
Service ..> Log : 9.1: erro(...) [somente se falhar]
Service ..> Ctrl : 10: ResultadoCadastro
Ctrl ..> Solicitante : 11: 201 + código de rastreio

@enduml
